{
  "_comment": [
    "Pricing in USD. Update as provider rates change.",
    "Chat models: input_per_1m / output_per_1m are per 1M tokens. For reasoning models",
    "(the gpt-5 family) reasoning tokens are billed as output tokens, so real cost can",
    "exceed a naive input+output estimate.",
    "TTS: text_input_per_1m and audio_output_per_1m are per 1M tokens. The speech",
    "endpoint returns no usage object, so tokens are estimated from character count -",
    "see TTS_TOKEN_ESTIMATES in src/services/budget.ts for the derivation.",
    "chars_per_1m is the legacy flat per-character rate; it understates real spend by",
    "~40% and is kept only so older pricing files keep loading."
  ],
